msgid "Video 11: Servo Motor | Single-Axis Solar Tracker using Photoresistors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:18
msgid "This tutorial dives into the essentials of controlling Servo Motors and building a single axis solar tracker using photo resistors, demonstrated through practical projects."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:20
msgid "**Servo Motor Basics**: Explains how Servo Motors work and how to connect and control them using PWM signals."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:21
msgid "**Servo Libraries**: Introduces the Servo and PWMServo libraries for controlling Servo Motors in Arduino."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:22
msgid "**Servo Control with Potentiometer**: Demonstrates how to control the position of a Servo Motor using a potentiometer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:23
msgid "**Servo Control with Photoresistor**: Shows how to use a photoresistor to control a Servo Motor, simulating light intensity changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:24
msgid "**Single Axis Solar Tracker**: Guides through building a solar tracker using two photoresistors to position a solar panel towards the light source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/arduino_video_course/video_11_Servo_Motor.rst:25
msgid "**Challenge Activity**: Modify the program to create a single axis solar tracker using two photoresistors, simulating East and West locations."
msgstr ""

